{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1118b268b2812e9f","name":"Communications Jammer","source":{"id":"source:reference-1118b268b2812e9f","title":"Communications Jammer","revision":21010,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:59:30Z","sha256":"d6b362dc561bd891a80bb2a76924df8319f87c3e7fd4776de77f919e59686a93","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21010","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Communications%20Jammer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1118b268b2812e9f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When behind enemy lines, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," takes every possible precaution to ensure that anyone who finds it is unable to call for help or alert others about the Droid's presence. The Communications Jammer allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to jam any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," signal by interfering with a facility's communications systems or by directly jamming signals in the Droid's general vicinity. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Communications Jammer grants a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to slice into a computer system and shut it down. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," also gets the +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to maintain that status if any slicers attempt to stop the jamming. Once the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," has successfully connected with the communications system and begun jamming, it can continue jamming the system until it disconnects or it is forced out.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The signal jammer emits signals at multiple frequencies to interfere with any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," signals within a 1-kilometer radius of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must make a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to successfully jam any incoming or outgoing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," signals.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
